# Heroes

## Warrior

**Role:** Tank / Frontline

The Warrior survives longer than any other hero, protecting allies while steadily wearing enemies down.

**Deck** (32 Hit Points)

- 10 Clubs
- 10 Spades
- 5 Hearts
- 7 Diamonds

**Stats**

- High Attack
- High Defence
- Low Spirit
- Largest deck

**Passive — Guardian**

May play Spades on teammates instead of only themselves.

**Abilities**

- **Crushing Blow** — Clubs — Ignore enemy Block.
- **Challenge** — Spades — All enemy attacks target the Warrior this round.
- **Battle Instinct** — Diamonds — Immediately play a Club from your discard pile.

---

## Rogue

**Role:** Assassin

Fast, fragile and explosive.

The Rogue relies on acting first and ending fights before enemies can respond.

**Deck** (26 Hit Points)

- 13 Clubs
- 3 Spades
- 3 Hearts
- 7 Diamonds

**Passive — First Strike**

If the Rogue has Initiative, their first basic attack each round resolves twice.

**Abilities**

- **Assassinate** — Clubs — Massive single-target damage after building enough Clubs.
- **Shadow Step** — Diamonds — Take the Initiative token at the end of the round.
- **Smoke Bomb** — Diamonds — Become Untargetable until your next turn. Enemy attacks choose another valid target.

---

## Priest

**Role:** Healer / Support

The Priest keeps the party alive by recovering discarded cards and enhancing teammates.

**Deck** (26 Hit Points)

- 3 Clubs
- 3 Spades
- 13 Hearts
- 7 Diamonds

**Passive — Divine Grace**

May play Hearts on allies.

**Abilities**

- **Greater Heal** — Hearts — Restore a large number of cards to one hero.
- **Prayer of Renewal** — Hearts — Heal every hero.
- **Blessing** — Black cards — A chosen hero may treat Diamonds as any suit during their next turn.

---

## Mage

**Role:** Control / Burst Damage

The Mage spends several turns preparing devastating spells.

**Deck** (29 Hit Points)

- 13 Clubs
- 3 Spades
- 3 Hearts
- 10 Diamonds

**Passive — Arcane Link**

May play Diamonds on allies.

**Abilities**

- **Fireball** — Clubs — Build power over several turns before unleashing enormous damage.
- **Freeze** — Diamonds — Freeze an enemy, causing all of their currently revealed cards to be discarded.
- **Ice Block** — Spades — Negate all damage taken until your next turn.

---

# Enemies

## Goblin Swarm

Small individually, overwhelming together.

**Stats**

- Attack: 2
- Defence: 1
- Spirit: 1
- Reveal: 3 cards

**Special Rule — Mob Tactics**

Whenever a revealed Club is adjacent to a Diamond, that attack is repeated multiple times, representing the Goblins surging forward as a pack.

---
## Troll

A slow but terrifying brute that refuses to stay wounded.

**Stats**

- High Attack
- High Defence
- Low Spirit
- Medium-sized deck
- Reveal: 2 cards

**Special Rule — Regeneration**

At the start of its turn, if the Troll was not damaged during the previous round, it recovers three cards from its discard pile back into its deck.

The Troll rewards relentless aggression. If the heroes ever stop pressuring it, its massive endurance quickly returns.
